sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant Browser
    participant Flask as Flask + flask_util
    participant Worker as Per-user worker
    participant Key as YubiKey
    participant DB as MySQL
    User->>Browser: Enter username and password
    Browser->>Flask: POST /api/login (HTTPS + CSRF)
    Flask->>Worker: Start Gateway.connect
    Worker->>DB: Password authentication
    DB-->>Worker: WebAuthn challenge
    Worker-->>Flask: Publish browser request
    Browser->>Flask: Poll login flow
    Flask-->>Browser: WebAuthn options
    Browser->>Key: navigator.credentials.get
    User->>Key: Touch key (PIN if requested)
    Key-->>Browser: Signed assertion
    Browser->>Flask: POST flow response
    Flask->>Worker: Deliver assertion
    Worker->>DB: WebAuthn response
    DB-->>Worker: Authentication OK
    Note over Worker,DB: Retain this user's authenticated connection
    Browser->>Flask: Poll success
    Flask-->>Browser: Rotate opaque cookie, open /main
    User->>Browser: Click Retrieve Hello World
    Browser->>Flask: POST /api/hello (CSRF)
    Flask->>Worker: Queue fixed query
    Worker->>DB: Health check and SELECT 'Hello World'
    DB-->>Worker: Greeting, account, connection ID
    Worker-->>Flask: Dictionary row
    Flask-->>Browser: Display Hello World
    User->>Browser: Log out
    Browser->>Flask: POST /api/logout (CSRF)
    Flask->>Worker: Revoke session and stop
    Worker->>DB: Close connection
    Flask-->>Browser: Return to /login
